<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak April industrial output rises 9.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovak April industrial output rises 9.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak real industrial output in April rose 9.0 percent, year-on-year, after rising 1.5 percent in March, the Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
